{"abstract":[{"text":"Manages undo history of scenes opened in the editor.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/17SwiftGodotRuntime6ObjectC"],"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/SQ","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/SH","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/s12IdentifiableP","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/17SwiftGodotRuntime18VariantConvertibleP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/editorundoredomanager"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/historyChanged","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/versionChanged"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/addDoMethod(object:method:_:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/addDoProperty(object:property:value:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/addDoReference(object:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/addUndoMethod(object:method:_:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/addUndoProperty(object:property:value:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/addUndoReference(object:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/clearHistory(id:increaseVersion:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/commitAction(execute:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/createAction(name:mergeMode:customContext:backwardUndoOps:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/forceFixedHistory()","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/getHistoryUndoRedo(id:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/getObjectHistoryId(object:)","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/isCommittingAction()"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/godotClassName"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/SpecialHistory"],"title":"Enumerations","generated":true}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EditorUndoRedoManager","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:10SwiftGodot21EditorUndoRedoManagerC","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EditorUndoRedoManager","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","title":"EditorUndoRedoManager","modules":[{"name":"SwiftGodot"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EditorUndoRedoManager"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is a manager for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" objects associated with edited scenes. Each scene has its own undo history and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" ensures that each action performed in the editor gets associated with a proper scene. For actions not related to scenes ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/ProjectSettings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" edits, external resources, etc.), a separate global history is used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The usage is mostly the same as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". You create and commit actions and the manager automatically decides under-the-hood what scenes it belongs to. The scene is deduced based on the first operation in an action, using the object from the operation. The rules are as follows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the object is a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Node"},{"type":"text","text":", use the currently edited scene;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the object is a built-in resource, use the scene from its path;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the object is external resource or anything else, use global history."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guessing can sometimes yield false results, so you can provide a custom context object when creating an action."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager"},{"text":" is intended to be used by Godot editor plugins. You can obtain it using ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorPlugin\/getUndoRedo()"},{"text":". For non-editor uses or plugins that don’t need to integrate with the editor’s undo history, use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo"},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The manager’s API is mostly the same as in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/UndoRedo","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so you can refer to its documentation for more examples. The main difference is that "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" uses object + method name for actions, instead of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Callable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This object emits the following signals:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/historyChanged"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager\/versionChanged"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorUndoRedoManager","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/EditorUndoRedoManager/addDoReference(object:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addDoReference","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"object","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Object","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifi